edings?</strong> </p>\n\n\n\n<p>A: Six months after the sale, but must occur within two years.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: Are there properties available over the counter?</strong> </p>\n\n\n\n<p>A: Yes, properties not sold at the auction can be purchased over the counter without bidding.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Useful Links</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://kent.marylandtaxsale.com/index.cfm?folder=showDocument&amp;documentName=taxCertificateProcess\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Kent County Tax Sale Information</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.kentcounty.com/finance\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Kent County Finance Department</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://kent.marylandtaxsale.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Kent County Auction Site</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-lien/tax-lien-states/maryland-tax-liens-earn-solid-as-a-beginner/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Earn Solid 6-20% ROI In Maryland Tax Liens!</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-lien/tax-lien-investing-overview/understanding-tax-lien-certificates/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Learn How Does Tax Lien Investing Work</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://youtu.be/eNKIUQC6io0?si=b31MOzg-xCeQzAUA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"